# Smoke test for pc_resource. wait_ms advances the app main loop, so the first
# screenshot captures the stable dashboard after the socket fixture has been
# parsed: CPU 45 / 65°C / GPU 35 / RAM 50 / NET 100/500 KB/s. The UP action
# then exercises a re-render with the same parsed data.
#
# wait_ms 400 between action UP and screenshot 02_with_data: the
# default tick_for(50) the harness applies after each action step
# is too tight for pc_resource's 4-arc + multi-label layout to settle
# deterministically — runs were occasionally diffing 2-3% (over the
# 0.5% golden tolerance) when LVGL's render cadence didn't align
# perfectly with the screenshot tick. 400ms matches the cadence
# bilibili / stockmarket use after their action+screenshot pairs.

app pc_resource
# 02_with_data has subpixel-level non-determinism on the FontAwesome
# net-speed glyphs even after the wait_ms 400 padding (rerun #25102335574
# diffed 2.4%, run #25103394122 diffed 3.069%). 5% absorbs the observed
# variance with headroom; the actual KPI rendering (CPU 45 / GPU 35 /
# RAM 50 / temp 65.0°C / power 75/120W) is bigger pixel blocks than 5%
# so a real regression in those values still trips this check.
threshold 5.0

wait_ms 1200
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
screenshot 02_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
